flowchart TD
    %% Governance Subgraph
    subgraph Governance
      DAO[GovernanceDAO]
      TL[TimelockController - Delay and Queue]
      Proposals[Proposal Lifecycle - Pending, Active, Succeeded, Queued, Executed, Defeated]
      Voting[Voting Process - for, against, abstain]
      Roles[Roles and Permissions]
      NBL[NBLToken - Governance Token]
    end

    %% Liquidity Subgraph
    subgraph Liquidity
      LP[LiquidityPool - AMM]
      Reserves[Pool Reserves]
      Oracle[PriceOracleTWAP - Oracle]
      LPUsers[Liquidity Providers]
    end

    %% Rewards Subgraph
    subgraph Rewards
      RS[RewardSystem - Rewards Distribution]
      Snapshots[Liquidity Snapshots]
      Booster[Booster Multipliers]
      Vester[TokenVester - Vesting]
      Claim[Reward Claim Function]
    end

    %% Governance Interactions
    DAO -->|Creates, Queues, Executes| Proposals
    DAO -->|Schedules proposals via| TL
    DAO -->|Conducts voting using| Voting
    DAO -->|Manages roles| Roles
    DAO -->|Oversees rewards| RS
    DAO -->|Controls vesting release| Vester
    Voting -->|Utilizes voting power from| NBL

    %% Liquidity Interactions
    LP -->|Fetches price from| Oracle
    LP -->|Updates| Reserves
    LPUsers -->|Provide liquidity to| LP
    LP -->|Generates fees for| DAO

    %% Oracle Details
    Oracle -->|Triggers fallback if consensus fails| RS

    %% Rewards Interactions
    RS -->|Calculates rewards using| Snapshots
    Snapshots -->|Captured from LP activity| LP
    RS -->|Applies booster multipliers from| Booster
    RS -->|Initiates vesting release via| Vester
    Vester -->|Releases vested tokens to| NBL
    RS -->|Reward claim function| Claim

    %% Cross-Module Connections
    LPUsers -->|May delegate tokens for voting| NBL
    Roles -->|Assigns governance rights to| DAO

    %% Detailing Proposal Cycle
    Proposals -->|States: Pending, Active, Succeeded, Queued, Executed, Defeated| DAO

    %% Additional Information
    Claim -->|Allows users to claim rewards| LPUsers
    Vester -->|Follows vesting schedule including cliff and gradual release| LPUsers
